    "en": "The title of an alert box (its icon and name)"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".markdown-alert-title { font-size: 15px; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-mermaid",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "図の枠（```mermaid で書いたフローチャート・シーケンス図）",
    "en": "The frame of a diagram (a flowchart or sequence diagram written in ```mermaid)"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-mermaid { background: var(--log-bg); }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-mermaid-zoom",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "図の右上の「拡大」ボタン",
    "en": "The Enlarge button on the top right corner of a diagram"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-mermaid-zoom { color: var(--log-accent); }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-mermaid-sheet",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "「拡大」で開く、画面いっぱいの図",
    "en": "The diagram over the whole screen, opened by Enlarge"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-mermaid-sheet { background: var(--log-card); }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-dg",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "描いた図（SVG）。--dg-edge（枠と矢印の色）・--dg-line（線の色）・--dg-box（箱の色）・--dg-ink（文字の色）で色を変えられます",
    "en": "A drawn diagram (SVG). Its colors follow --dg-edge (frames and strong arrows), --dg-line (lines), --dg-box (boxes) and --dg-ink (words)"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-dg { --dg-edge: #e0607e; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-frame",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "ページ埋込（[ページ埋込]URL[/ページ埋込]）の全体。--frame-width で枠の幅を変えられます",
    "en": "A page embed ([Embed]URL[/Embed]) as a whole. --frame-width sets the width of its frame"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-frame { --frame-width: 100%; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-frame-stage",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "ページ埋込の枠（読み込む前は表紙、押すとページ）",
    "en": "The frame of a page embed (its cover, then the page once pressed)"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-frame-stage { border-radius: 0; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-frame-play",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "ページ埋込の表紙の「ページを読み込む」ステッカー",
    "en": "The Load the page sticker on a page embed’s cover"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-frame-play { transform: none; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  },
  {
   "name": ".log-frame-bar",
   "purpose": {
    "ja": "ページ埋込の下の行（別のタブで開くリンクと「全画面」ボタン）",
    "en": "The row under a page embed (the link to open it in a new tab and the Full screen button)"
   },
   "pages": [
    "post",
    "page"
   ],
   "example": ".log-frame-bar { font-size: 13px; }",
   "since": "0.11.0"
  }
 ],
